    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="NFR-07">Verify the review surface + "Communications Awaiting Association" view are matter-level auth-scoped in the deployed env (ADR-003/008); AI privilege appears as a flag only (ADR-015).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-021">Dark + light mode rendering MUST be verified for both PCFs (Fluent v9 theme).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-022">Deploy per PCF conventions (virtual controls, platform libraries); `npm run build:prod` before packaging (FAILURE-MODES AP-1).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">The OOB `sprk_communication` form MUST remain openable post-deploy (reversibility) — verify, do not break.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Keep the Create-To-Do ribbon button (live feature); remove only the Send button/web resource.</constraint>
  </constraints>

