  <steps>
    <step order="1">`npm run build:prod` both PCFs (confirm clean single bundles — already verified in 042/044).</step>
    <step order="2">Package both PCFs into solution(s) mirroring `RegardingResolver/Solution/`; `pac solution import` (or `pac pcf push`) to the dev env.</step>
    <step order="3">Configure the OOB `sprk_communication` form: place CommunicationConnections (bound to `sprk_associationprovenance` + `sprk_associationstatus`) in the accessories column; place CommunicationActions (bound to `sprk_communicationtype`) in the command area with auth-config inputs from env variables. Publish.</step>
    <step order="4">Pack + import the "Communications Awaiting Association" savedquery (FetchXML/layoutXML from CommunicationConnections/views/).</step>
    <step order="5">Remove the deployed Send web resource + ribbon button (re-import the emptied CommunicationRibbons solution or admin-delete). Keep Create-To-Do.</step>
    <step order="6">UI verify (dark + light): Connections renders slots + confirm/primary/create-from-email; Actions renders the bar + opens the composer + Save-to-SharePoint calls /{id}/archive; the OOB form still opens. File failures as deferrals; do not silently pass.</step>
    <step order="9.5">FULL-rigor gates: `code-review` on deploy/config diffs; `adr-check` (ADR-021/022/003/008/015 + §10). Address Critical findings.</step>
    <step order="10">Update `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md` (043 ✅; confirm 060 unblocked) + `current-task.md` (record deploy env + control names). Run `context-handoff`.</step>
  </steps>

  <tools>
    <tool name="bash">npm run build:prod; pac solution / pac pcf push</tool>
    <tool name="code-review">FULL-rigor gate</tool>
    <tool name="adr-check">FULL-rigor gate</tool>
  </tools>

  <outputs>
    <output type="deploy">Both PCFs deployed + placed on the OOB sprk_communication form; "Awaiting Association" view; Send button removed (Create-To-Do kept)</output>
    <output type="test">UI verification results (pass/fail + evidence) + any deferred-issue filings</output>
    <output type="docs">Task notes: deploy env, control names, form-config summary</output>
  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Both PCFs are deployed and placed on the OOB `sprk_communication` form; publish succeeds.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">CommunicationConnections renders the multi-association review (slots + confidence + confirm + primary + create-from-email) against a real record.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">CommunicationActions renders Reply/Forward/Send/Save/Save-to-SharePoint; the composer opens; Save-to-SharePoint calls `/api/communications/{id}/archive`.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The "Communications Awaiting Association" view exists, lists only Suggested/Pending Review/Ambiguous, and is matter-level auth-scoped.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The deployed Send web resource + ribbon button are removed; the Create-To-Do button remains; the OOB form still opens.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Dark + light mode verified (ADR-021). Any failing check fixed or filed as a deferred issue linked in task notes.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>
    Closes Wave 4 (OOB form + PCFs). Supersedes the pre-pivot Code-Page-deploy content. Task 060 (W6 caller migration) depends on this. This is an OUTWARD-FACING live deploy — it needs a target Dataverse environment + `pac` auth + a browser session; confirm the target + authorization before importing.
  </notes>

